WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.134 --> 00:00:03.169
-Former Vice President
Mike Pence

00:00:03.169 --> 00:00:05.137
was heckled and called a traitor

00:00:05.137 --> 00:00:06.873
at a conservative conference
last week

00:00:06.873 --> 00:00:08.440
by a group
of antifa socialists.

00:00:08.440 --> 00:00:09.775
Wait, sorry, I read that wrong.

00:00:09.775 --> 00:00:11.177
By his own party.

00:00:11.177 --> 00:00:13.747
Meanwhile, the GOP's sham
election audit in Arizona

00:00:13.747 --> 00:00:15.782
has taken yet
another bizarre turn,

00:00:15.782 --> 00:00:18.017
with copies of voting data
being driven

00:00:18.017 --> 00:00:19.919
to a mysterious location
in Montana.

00:00:19.919 --> 00:00:22.321
For more on this,
it's time for "A Closer Look."

00:00:22.321 --> 00:00:26.426
♪♪

00:00:26.426 --> 00:00:28.794
We're five months
into Joe Biden's presidency

00:00:28.794 --> 00:00:30.363
and, yet, Republicans
are still obsessed

00:00:30.363 --> 00:00:33.133
with trying to overturn the
results of the 2020 election

00:00:33.133 --> 00:00:35.401
and rewrite the history
of what happened

00:00:35.401 --> 00:00:37.970
during the January 6th
insurrection at the Capitol.

00:00:37.970 --> 00:00:41.307
This weekend, for example,
Wisconsin Senator Ron Johnson

00:00:41.307 --> 00:00:44.543
and Fox host Maria Bartiromo
once again repeated the lie

00:00:44.543 --> 00:00:46.545
that none of the
insurrectionists were armed.

00:00:46.545 --> 00:00:49.014
-Armed insurrection
is what Nancy Pelosi

00:00:49.014 --> 00:00:50.983
keeps calling January 6th,
Senator.

00:00:50.983 --> 00:00:54.554 line:0%
How many guns were actually
taken up on that day,

00:00:54.554 --> 00:00:57.123 line:0%
since she says it was armed?

00:00:57.123 --> 00:00:58.691 line:0%
-By the way, they always talk

00:00:58.691 --> 00:01:01.594 line:0%
about thousands
of armed insurrectionists.

00:01:01.594 --> 00:01:03.062 line:0%
I asked the FBI witness.

00:01:03.062 --> 00:01:04.330 line:0%
Not one.

00:01:04.330 --> 00:01:06.799 line:0%
Not one gun was recovered,
either in the Capitol

00:01:06.799 --> 00:01:08.868 line:0%
or on the Capitol grounds,
according to that FBI witness,

00:01:08.868 --> 00:01:12.271 line:0%
so that's just one
of the latest big lies.

00:01:12.271 --> 00:01:15.008
-And, as we all know, guns are
the only types of weapons.

00:01:15.008 --> 00:01:17.409
That's why you're allowed to get
on an airplane with nunchucks

00:01:17.409 --> 00:01:19.011
and giant medieval battle-axes.

00:01:19.011 --> 00:01:20.579
And, yet, every time I go
through security

00:01:20.579 --> 00:01:23.149
with my nunchucks and battle-ax,
security's always like,

00:01:23.149 --> 00:01:24.584
"Um, excuse me, sir.

00:01:24.584 --> 00:01:25.918
You can't take that with you."

00:01:25.918 --> 00:01:27.119
And then I have to remind them

00:01:27.119 --> 00:01:29.922
that, under Article 47
of the U.S. Constitution,

00:01:29.922 --> 00:01:31.590
part 9, subsection 23(B),

00:01:31.590 --> 00:01:35.094
nunchucks and battle-axes are
allowed on airplanes.

00:01:35.094 --> 00:01:36.963
And they say, "No,
I meant the shampoo.

00:01:36.963 --> 00:01:38.297
That's clearly
a four-ounce bottle."

00:01:38.297 --> 00:01:40.166
And then, to ease the tension,
I say something like,

00:01:40.166 --> 00:01:41.367
"Hey, you can't have
this battle-ax,

00:01:41.367 --> 00:01:42.569
but you can have
this one over there,"

00:01:42.569 --> 00:01:43.769
[ Laughing ]
and then, I gesture to my wife

00:01:43.769 --> 00:01:45.071
and we all have a good laugh.

00:01:45.071 --> 00:01:46.439
[ Laughter ]
Well, not all of us.

00:01:46.439 --> 00:01:48.141
Someone takes it very personally

00:01:48.141 --> 00:01:50.242
and then, it's a thing
the whole vacation.

00:01:50.242 --> 00:01:51.945
[ Laughter ]
Also,

00:01:51.945 --> 00:01:54.079
more importantly,
none of that is true.

00:01:54.079 --> 00:01:57.049
Last week, prosecutors charged
a fourth Capital riot defendant

00:01:57.049 --> 00:01:58.885
with a firearms violation.

00:01:58.885 --> 00:02:00.753
And, aside from guns,
according to CNN...

00:02:16.936 --> 00:02:18.437
If a dude broke your window

00:02:18.437 --> 00:02:20.773
and busted into your house
with a hockey stick at 3:00 am

00:02:20.773 --> 00:02:22.475
and said, "Don't worry.
I'm not armed,"

00:02:22.475 --> 00:02:24.043
you wouldn't say like,
"Oh, alright, well,

00:02:24.043 --> 00:02:25.177
you want to crack a beer

00:02:25.177 --> 00:02:27.012
and watch the highlights
from the Islanders game?

00:02:27.012 --> 00:02:29.448
Did you see that save
by Ryan Pulock?!

00:02:29.448 --> 00:02:31.950
Hey, where are you going
with my vase?"

00:02:31.950 --> 00:02:34.354
[ Laughter ]
And then, at the end
of the interview, Bartiromo,

00:02:34.354 --> 00:02:36.856
one of the most unhinged
conspiracy theorists on Fox,

00:02:36.856 --> 00:02:38.557
applauded herself
for telling the truth.

00:02:38.557 --> 00:02:40.826 line:0%
-We have been telling
every story.

00:02:40.826 --> 00:02:44.197 line:0%
We've been on the right side
of it for seven years going.

00:02:44.197 --> 00:02:47.266 line:0%
I've been trashed every day
along the way.

00:02:47.266 --> 00:02:48.301 line:0%
Keep trashing me!

00:02:48.301 --> 00:02:49.935 line:0%
I'll keep telling the truth!

00:02:49.935 --> 00:02:52.238
-That sounds like a catchphrase
from the opening credits of...

00:02:54.340 --> 00:02:55.341
[ Laughter ]
[ As Bartiromo ]
Keep trashing me!

00:02:55.341 --> 00:02:56.843
I'll keep telling the truth!

00:02:56.843 --> 00:02:58.211
Andy!

00:02:58.211 --> 00:03:01.114
Andy, stop hitting your brother
with the pool skimmer!

00:03:01.114 --> 00:03:02.548
Andy!

00:03:02.548 --> 00:03:03.683
Put that down right now!

00:03:03.683 --> 00:03:04.883
I'm going to call your father!

00:03:04.883 --> 00:03:06.785
What's that?
Oh, you're unarmed

00:03:06.785 --> 00:03:08.354
because it's just
a pool skimmer?

00:03:08.354 --> 00:03:09.488
Now, he's getting cute with me.

00:03:09.488 --> 00:03:11.390
Andy Michael Piazza DeAngelo,

00:03:11.390 --> 00:03:13.693
put it down right now,
or I will end you!

00:03:13.693 --> 00:03:15.495
[ Laughter ]

00:03:15.495 --> 00:03:18.297
These people have been
desperately cycling

00:03:18.297 --> 00:03:20.867
through one deranged
conspiracy theory after another,

00:03:20.867 --> 00:03:23.903 line:0%
in an attempt to lie about what
really happened on January 6th.

00:03:23.903 --> 00:03:27.006 line:0%
Some tried to claim it was
largely a peaceful protest,

00:03:27.006 --> 00:03:28.707 line:0%
no worse than
a "normal tourist visit,"

00:03:28.707 --> 00:03:31.444 line:0%
while others suggested
that it was actually the FBI

00:03:31.444 --> 00:03:34.446 line:0%
and the deep state that secretly
orchestrated the whole thing,

00:03:34.446 --> 00:03:35.949 line:0%
as a false flag operation.

00:03:35.949 --> 00:03:37.917 line:0%
And then, there were those
who blamed

00:03:37.917 --> 00:03:40.586 line:0%
so-called fake Trump supporters
or antifa,

00:03:40.586 --> 00:03:43.189 line:0%
despite the pro-Trump rioters
themselves going online

00:03:43.189 --> 00:03:44.691 line:0%
and contradicting that lie.

00:03:44.691 --> 00:03:46.492 line:0%
-The people who stormed
the Capitol

00:03:46.492 --> 00:03:48.961 line:0%
had to convince their own
brethren on social media

00:03:48.961 --> 00:03:50.763 line:0%
they weren't antifa,

00:03:50.763 --> 00:03:53.199 line:0%
like Brian Nichols, a Marine
veteran charged in the attack,

00:03:53.199 --> 00:03:54.500 line:0%
who wrote on Facebook,
"Hey..."

00:04:02.408 --> 00:04:04.443
-You know it's bad when
even the insurrectionists

00:04:04.443 --> 00:04:05.911
are fact-checking Republicans.

00:04:05.911 --> 00:04:08.281
Soon, anti-vaxxers are going
to start tweeting stuff like...

00:04:13.519 --> 00:04:15.621
They can't even get the people
they're lying about

00:04:15.621 --> 00:04:16.956
to go along with the lie.

00:04:16.956 --> 00:04:19.659
It would be like if OJ
got up in court and said,

00:04:19.659 --> 00:04:20.993
"Those gloves fit just fine.

00:04:20.993 --> 00:04:22.528
I was making my hands big
on purpose,"

00:04:22.528 --> 00:04:28.267
and then, Judge Ito looks
at the camera and says, "Juice!"

00:04:28.267 --> 00:04:29.569
I feel like that's what he'd do.

00:04:29.569 --> 00:04:31.471
[ Laughter ]
I was younger then.

00:04:31.471 --> 00:04:33.172 line:0%
In reality, of course,
the insurrection was

00:04:33.172 --> 00:04:36.342 line:0%
an attempt to stop the lawful
counting of electoral votes

00:04:36.342 --> 00:04:38.277
and overturn the results
to keep Trump in power.

00:04:38.277 --> 00:04:41.614
In fact, a large faction
of GOP officials and voters

00:04:41.614 --> 00:04:44.851
are still very much committed
to the big lie

00:04:44.851 --> 00:04:46.452
that fueled the riot,
in the first place.

00:04:46.452 --> 00:04:48.688
A new poll out today finds
that...

00:04:55.828 --> 00:04:58.464
...and last week, former
Vice President Mike Pence

00:04:58.464 --> 00:05:00.566
was heckled and called a traitor

00:05:00.566 --> 00:05:02.635
at the conservative
Faith &amp; Freedom Coalition

00:05:02.635 --> 00:05:04.036
because he didn't singlehandedly

00:05:04.036 --> 00:05:05.804
overturn the results
of the election,

00:05:05.804 --> 00:05:07.807
which he didn't have
the power to do, anyway.

00:05:07.807 --> 00:05:10.109
-Pence is the one seen
on surveillance video

00:05:10.109 --> 00:05:14.546
being rushed to safety by the
Secret Service on January 6th.

00:05:14.546 --> 00:05:18.518 line:0%
Remember, rioters could be heard
chanting, "Hang Mike Pence."

00:05:18.518 --> 00:05:21.053 line:0%
Trump had accused him
of being disloyal

00:05:21.053 --> 00:05:22.789 line:0%
for following the Constitution

00:05:22.789 --> 00:05:25.924 line:0%
and refusing to overturn
the election results.

00:05:25.924 --> 00:05:28.694 line:0%
Well, today, Pence spoke
to religious conservatives

00:05:28.694 --> 00:05:31.964 line:0%
at the Faith &amp; Freedom
Coalition Conference

00:05:31.964 --> 00:05:33.766 line:0%
and, as he tried to speak,

00:05:33.766 --> 00:05:38.070 line:0%
boos and cries of "traitor"
rained down from the crowd.

00:05:38.070 --> 00:05:41.673 line:0%
-It is great to be back
with so many patriots.

00:05:41.673 --> 00:05:43.643 line:0%
And I want to thank
my friend Ralph Reed

00:05:43.643 --> 00:05:46.079 line:0%
for those overly generous words.

00:05:46.079 --> 00:05:49.181 line:0%
I'm deeply humbled by them.

00:05:49.181 --> 00:05:52.485 line:0%
And Ralph Reed knows me
well enough to know

00:05:52.485 --> 00:05:56.088 line:0%
the introduction I prefer
is a little bit shorter.

00:05:56.088 --> 00:05:59.258
I'm a Christian, a conservative,
and a Republican,

00:05:59.258 --> 00:06:01.394
in that order.

00:06:01.394 --> 00:06:03.863
-Man, that's like getting booed
throwing out a first pitch

00:06:03.863 --> 00:06:05.531
at a baseball game
in your home state,

00:06:05.531 --> 00:06:06.899
which also happened
to Mike Pence.

00:06:08.900 --> 00:06:12.705
-[ Booing and whistling ]

00:06:12.705 --> 00:06:14.540
[ Applause ]
-[Bleep] you!

00:06:14.540 --> 00:06:16.108
-You suck!

00:06:16.108 --> 00:06:17.843
[ Laughter ]
-Booing is one thing,

00:06:17.843 --> 00:06:19.912
but they're calling Pence
a traitor

00:06:19.912 --> 00:06:21.881
and he tries to just keep
giving his speech

00:06:21.881 --> 00:06:23.182
and act like it's not happening.

00:06:23.182 --> 00:06:26.351
Pence could really use
a Smithers right about now.

00:06:26.351 --> 00:06:27.619
[ As Smithers ]
They're not saying traitor.
They're saying,

00:06:27.619 --> 00:06:29.855
"Tra-yay!-tor."

00:06:29.855 --> 00:06:31.824
[ Laughter ]
Also, it's a gathering

00:06:31.824 --> 00:06:33.259
of religious conservatives,

00:06:33.259 --> 00:06:35.561
called the
Faith &amp; Freedom Coalition.

00:06:35.561 --> 00:06:37.563
Pence should be able to walk
into that place

00:06:37.563 --> 00:06:39.499
like Norm walking into Cheers.

00:06:39.499 --> 00:06:40.666
"Mike!

00:06:40.666 --> 00:06:42.034
What's shaking, Mr. Pence?"

00:06:42.034 --> 00:06:44.803
[ As Pence ] The knees
of the faithless, Woody.

00:06:44.803 --> 00:06:47.673
[ Laughter ]
If Pence should be popular
anywhere, it's there,

00:06:47.673 --> 00:06:49.141
and, yet, he's still
getting booed.

00:06:49.141 --> 00:06:51.743
That's like the Kardashians
getting booed on E!

00:06:51.743 --> 00:06:53.446 line:0%
-Did you get Kendall a present?

00:06:53.446 --> 00:06:54.880 line:0%
-I did.
-What'd you get?

00:06:54.880 --> 00:06:55.915 line:0%
-Something for her lake house.

00:06:55.915 --> 00:06:57.015 line:0%
-[ Booing ]
-Oh, nice.

00:06:57.015 --> 00:06:58.350 line:0%
-You suck!

00:06:58.350 --> 00:06:59.685
-And, yeah, I'm aware

00:06:59.685 --> 00:07:02.020
the Kardashians have been
moved from E! to Hulu.

00:07:02.020 --> 00:07:03.622
Just because most
of my references are

00:07:03.622 --> 00:07:05.124
from the '70s and '80s

00:07:05.124 --> 00:07:07.159
doesn't mean I don't know
anything about the Kardashians.

00:07:07.159 --> 00:07:08.527
I know pop culture better

00:07:08.527 --> 00:07:12.865
than Radar O'Reilly knows
the sound of a helicopter.

00:07:12.865 --> 00:07:14.600
[ Laughter ]
As Mike Pence
has now discovered,

00:07:14.600 --> 00:07:17.536
the core organizing principle
of the GOP right now is

00:07:17.536 --> 00:07:19.805
its fundamental hostility
to democracy

00:07:19.805 --> 00:07:21.107
and the movement's
central belief is

00:07:21.107 --> 00:07:23.809
the big lie that the
2020 election was stolen.

00:07:23.809 --> 00:07:26.145
More than half a Republicans
said, in a recent poll,

00:07:26.145 --> 00:07:29.982
that they still believe election
reviews will change the outcome,

00:07:29.982 --> 00:07:31.550
like the sham audit in Arizona,

00:07:31.550 --> 00:07:35.087
where Republicans have been
hunting for, among other things,

00:07:35.087 --> 00:07:36.856
bamboo fibers,
to prove that ballots

00:07:36.856 --> 00:07:38.124
were smuggled in from China;

00:07:38.124 --> 00:07:40.426
and secret watermarks,
left by Trump,

00:07:40.426 --> 00:07:43.162
that separate the real ballots
from the fake ones.

00:07:43.162 --> 00:07:45.932
They think Trump watermarked
ballots when, in reality,

00:07:45.932 --> 00:07:48.500
the only thing he's ever
watermarked is a desk.

00:07:48.500 --> 00:07:50.702
I guarantee Trump has never used
a coaster in his life,

00:07:50.702 --> 00:07:52.371
even though
"Coaster" was probably

00:07:52.371 --> 00:07:53.806
his nickname in high school.

00:07:53.806 --> 00:07:56.843
"Hey Coaster, is it true you had
someone else take your SATs?"

00:07:56.843 --> 00:07:59.378
[ As Trump ]
All that matters is
I got into "Peen."

00:07:59.378 --> 00:08:00.479
"Do you mean Penn?"

00:08:00.479 --> 00:08:01.714
[ As Trump ]
Cicada, "sih-kah-duh."

00:08:01.714 --> 00:08:03.716
[ Laughter ]
In fact,

00:08:03.716 --> 00:08:06.485
the Arizona audit has gotten
so far off the rails

00:08:06.485 --> 00:08:08.854
that copies of voting data
have been taken

00:08:08.854 --> 00:08:11.924
to a mysterious location
somewhere in rural Montana,

00:08:11.924 --> 00:08:14.293
all in the name
of election integrity.

00:08:14.293 --> 00:08:16.195
CNN even tried
to find the location

00:08:16.195 --> 00:08:19.431
and sent a reporter
to the woods to look for it.

00:08:19.431 --> 00:08:22.568
-On this piece of property
in a remote part of Montana,

00:08:22.568 --> 00:08:24.036
people may,
at this very minute,

00:08:24.036 --> 00:08:27.473 line:0%
be analyzing voting data
from the state of Arizona,

00:08:27.473 --> 00:08:29.675 line:0%
as part of the so-called
Arizona audit,

00:08:29.675 --> 00:08:31.644 line:0%
run by the Cyber Ninjas,

00:08:31.644 --> 00:08:34.546 line:0%
a company whose CEO
had previously espoused

00:08:34.546 --> 00:08:37.383 line:0%
Trump-style election
conspiracy theories.

00:08:37.383 --> 00:08:39.651 line:0%
What does Montana have to do
with all this?

00:08:39.651 --> 00:08:41.888 line:0%
Ken Bennett is a spokesman
for the audit.

00:08:41.888 --> 00:08:44.957 line:0%
-Everything that Cyber Ninjas
is doing,

00:08:44.957 --> 00:08:46.792 line:0%
they're either doing
with their own expertise

00:08:46.792 --> 00:08:49.094 line:0%
or the expertise of the people
that are hired.

00:08:49.094 --> 00:08:50.128
[ Laughter ]
-Cool. Well, thanks

00:08:50.128 --> 00:08:51.897
to Republican
conspiracy theories,

00:08:51.897 --> 00:08:54.200
we have CNN reporters running
around in the woods

00:08:54.200 --> 00:08:56.434
like they're auditioning
for "Finding Bigfoot."

00:08:56.434 --> 00:08:59.638
Also, you trust a company
that calls itself Cyber Ninjas

00:08:59.638 --> 00:09:01.239
to hire people with expertise?

00:09:01.239 --> 00:09:03.776
It sounds like a game
for Super Nintendo

00:09:03.776 --> 00:09:05.444
you'd find at the bottom
of the bargain bin

00:09:05.444 --> 00:09:07.112
at GameStop in 1994,

00:09:07.112 --> 00:09:10.382 line:0%
or a [bleep] Steven Seagal
ripoff of "Robocop."

00:09:10.382 --> 00:09:11.584 line:0%
"You're too late, copper.

00:09:11.584 --> 00:09:13.585 line:0%
We already got the jewels
from the safe."

00:09:13.585 --> 00:09:14.620 line:0%
[ As Seagal ]
I'm not a cop.

00:09:14.620 --> 00:09:16.255 line:0%
I'm a cyber ninja.

00:09:16.255 --> 00:09:18.391 line:0%
Digital nunchucks, activate.

00:09:18.391 --> 00:09:20.792 line:0%
Wh-What do you mean,
I can't get on the plane?

00:09:20.792 --> 00:09:22.427 line:0%
Am I supposed to walk
to my dojo?

00:09:22.427 --> 00:09:24.663 line:0%
[ Laughter ]
But the story
keeps getting weirder.

00:09:24.663 --> 00:09:26.498
Even the spokesman
for the Arizona audit

00:09:26.498 --> 00:09:28.167
apparently has no idea

00:09:28.167 --> 00:09:30.602
where the Cyber Ninjas
have taken the voting data.

00:09:30.602 --> 00:09:34.340
-And the contractor it hired
is called Cipher, LLC.

00:09:34.340 --> 00:09:35.807
Bennett says
Cipher was permitted

00:09:35.807 --> 00:09:40.112 line:0%
to take copies of Arizona
voting system data on a truck

00:09:40.112 --> 00:09:41.847 line:0%
and have it driven to Montana,

00:09:41.847 --> 00:09:44.349 line:0%
where it's being
"forensically evaluated,"

00:09:44.349 --> 00:09:45.418 line:0%
in what he described

00:09:45.418 --> 00:09:47.853 line:0%
as a "secure,
powerful laboratory."

00:09:47.853 --> 00:09:51.090 line:0%
But nobody is publicly saying
what that actually means

00:09:51.090 --> 00:09:54.359 line:0%
and Bennett tells us he doesn't
know where the so-called lab is.

00:09:54.359 --> 00:09:56.328 line:0%
It is apparently a secret.

00:09:56.328 --> 00:09:57.763
-Wait, so we're supposed
to believe

00:09:57.763 --> 00:10:00.933
there's a secret, powerful
laboratory in rural Montana

00:10:00.933 --> 00:10:03.936
where experts are doing
forensic analysis on ballots?

00:10:03.936 --> 00:10:06.872
Also, why do I keep saying
"rural Montana"?

00:10:06.872 --> 00:10:08.506
"Montana" is fine.

00:10:08.506 --> 00:10:10.542
There's no urban Montana.

00:10:10.542 --> 00:10:13.278
"You'll never make it on the
mean streets of Billings, kid."

00:10:13.278 --> 00:10:15.548
[ Laughter ]
And, look, I love Montana,

00:10:15.548 --> 00:10:16.748
but I'm having trouble believing

00:10:16.748 --> 00:10:18.717
there's some secret,
powerful laboratory

00:10:18.717 --> 00:10:20.286
where they're doing
forensic analysis

00:10:20.286 --> 00:10:21.320
hidden in the middle of nowhere,

00:10:21.320 --> 00:10:22.688
unless it was built
by Tony Stark.

00:10:22.688 --> 00:10:23.722
[ Gasp ]

00:10:23.722 --> 00:10:24.856
And, if that were true,

00:10:24.856 --> 00:10:26.391
then the only person
who'd be able to find it

00:10:26.391 --> 00:10:27.926
would be Loki.
[ Gasp ]

00:10:27.926 --> 00:10:30.362
But, wait! It's just like Loki
to use a sham audit

00:10:30.362 --> 00:10:32.130
as an excuse to alter
the sacred timeline.

00:10:32.130 --> 00:10:33.132
Oh, my God.
Oh, my God!

00:10:33.132 --> 00:10:35.601
Is this --
Is this a nexus event?

00:10:35.601 --> 00:10:38.837
Have the Timekeepers
lost control of the variant?

00:10:38.837 --> 00:10:40.673
Oh, God!

00:10:40.673 --> 00:10:43.776
Does this mean there won't be
a "Wedding Crashers" sequel?

00:10:43.776 --> 00:10:45.110
[ Laughter ]
[ As Wilson ] Jeez, man, relax!

00:10:45.110 --> 00:10:47.980
It's just a TV show.

00:10:47.980 --> 00:10:49.782
You're losing the plot, man.

00:10:49.782 --> 00:10:52.217
[ Laughter ]
The Biden presidency can feel

00:10:52.217 --> 00:10:54.319
deceptively calm,
compared to the Trump era,

00:10:54.319 --> 00:10:56.455
but there's a brewing crisis
on the horizon.

00:10:56.455 --> 00:10:58.791
One of our two
major political parties

00:10:58.791 --> 00:11:00.693
is controlled
by an authoritarian faction

00:11:00.693 --> 00:11:02.494
that is radicalized
against democracy.

00:11:02.494 --> 00:11:04.029
They're still trying
to overturn the results

00:11:04.029 --> 00:11:05.430
of the last election,

00:11:05.430 --> 00:11:08.100
all while making it easier
to overturn the next election.

00:11:08.100 --> 00:11:09.501
Republicans believe
they're the only ones

00:11:09.501 --> 00:11:11.303
who can legitimately
win elections,

00:11:11.303 --> 00:11:13.238
no matter how many times
voters tell them...

00:11:13.238 --> 00:11:14.840
-You suck!

00:11:14.840 --> 00:11:16.775
[ Laughter ]
-This has been "A Closer Look."

00:11:16.775 --> 00:11:20.879
♪♪

00:11:20.879 --> 00:11:22.347
God's Love We Deliver
cooks and brings

00:11:22.347 --> 00:11:23.949
over two million meals a year

00:11:23.949 --> 00:11:26.084
to men, women, and children
living with HIV/AIDS,

00:11:26.084 --> 00:11:27.753
cancer, and other
serious illnesses

00:11:27.753 --> 00:11:29.721
and they need your help,
now, more than ever.

00:11:29.721 --> 00:11:32.357
If you're watching this online,
you can hit the Donate button.

00:11:32.357 --> 00:11:34.927
Stay safe. Get vaccinated.
We love you.

